 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in browsers with that API enabled. Each tool is available while its form is on
+the page, accepts required `username` and `password` strings, and submits through
+the same client-side handler as the visible form. Invocations automatically
+submit and return `{ success: boolean, message: string }` after the API request
+finishes, including API and network errors. Credentials and authentication tokens
+are not included in the tool result. Browsers without WebMCP keep the normal form
+behavior.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
